SY_TALK("plk0Orzhpfo",[[6,["Today you all have gathered here"]],[12,["to worship Me as your Guru."]],[21,["I must say that I lack many qualities"]],[26,["that a guru should have,"]],[31,["in the sense I cannot be strict with you,"]],[37,["I cannot be stern with you,"]],[41,["and I really don’t know how to punish you for doing wrong things."]],[51,["This may be because, normally I think"]],[56,["the gurus have problems with their disciples,"]],[64,["who are mostly not realized souls."]],[70,["As they are not realized souls,"]],[71,["the gurus find it difficult to communicate"]],[78,["or talk to them"]],[84,["about the subtle problems that they have."]],[94,["I know of many gurus"]],[98,["even in modern times"]],[100,["who’ve been really very, very strict."]],[110,["And also they told Me"]],[115,["that they have achieved their realization"]],[121,["by working very hard"]],[124,["and by suffering under the strictness of the gurus."]],[136,["Sometimes I was really filled with great compassion for such disciples"]],[144,["who haven't yet received their realization."]],[148,["They had gurus who were really realized souls"]],[155,["and they never had their realization,"]],[160,["and the guru was extremely strict with them."]],[168,["There was one gentleman I met in Kolhapur,"]],[177,["and he got realization in one minute."]],[182,["So he told Me that his guru had \"told me"]],[188,["to go for fast every month at least for eight days.\""]],[196,["All right. \"Then he asked me"]],[199,["to build a temple of Dattatreya in his village.\""]],[205,["And every day he must go and worship Dattatreya"]],[211,["in the morning time and in the evening time."]],[216,["He spent so much money,"]],[220,["and still he didn't get realization."]],[223,["\"And while You hardly took two minutes to give me realization, Mother."]],[227,["What is this?"]],[229,["How You have been so gracious to me?\""]],[238,["So, I didn't know what to answer him"]],[241,["I didn't want to talk against his guru"]],[243,["because I know he is a realized soul."]],[252,["Actually, most of these gurus"]],[256,["and incarnations"]],[262,["were very helpless with human beings."]],[266,["Perhaps they didn't have such beautiful disciples as I have."]],[274,["Perhaps at this time all the good people"]],[281,["who were seeking Divinity are born,"]],[286,["and they are here as Sahaja yogis."]],[294,["I never had to work very hard on them."]],[299,["Of course once in a while you do get a person"]],[303,["who tries to trouble us, or who tries to create problems."]],[309,["But modern times are so special, I think,"]],[315,["that it's very easy to give realization to people."]],[326,["At the time of Moses, He had made laws"]],[332,["because of the decadent society of the Jews at that time."]],[339,["And that one was very hard, very, very hard,"]],[346,["which we know today as shariat –"]],[350,["was taken over by the Muslims."]],[355,["And even now the punishments according to so-called Koran"]],[361,["are so hard that you can't believe it."]],[365,["And most of the pressure of all their dharmic laws are on the women."]],[375,["Whatever it is, even in the Bible if you read Christ,"]],[382,["He has said that"]],[386,["all those Ten Commandments are nothing,"]],[392,["you have to go beyond them."]],[396,["And He says if your one eye is mischievous,"]],[400,["is committing sin, take it out."]],[404,["What's the use of the whole body getting contaminated by that?"]],[408,["Or if your one arm is doing something that is wrong,"]],[417,["you better remove it."]],[420,["Because of one arm, the whole body will suffer."]],[426,["He said that, it is said that you should not be adulterous."]],[432,["But I would say that you should not have eyes"]],[439,["in which for any woman you have desire-"]],[443,["you have committed the great sin;"]],[446,["and you'll all go to hell, all those people who will do it."]],[449,["So you should not have adulterous eyes."]],[455,["Another thing He has said,"]],[458,["that if somebody slaps you on one face,"]],[462,["you should turn another cheek towards that person."]],[473,["When I knew about these laws I said,"]],[477,["How can you have such people in this world?"]],[481,["It's a very subtle thing."]],[484,["And the last of all which was very, very good was"]],[488,["that you should be righteous,"]],[492,["righteous more than all the scribes and all the Pharisees"]],[498,["– means the priest and all this with the –"]],[500,["you have to be much more righteous than them."]],[506,["I mean, in early age when I read it I thought,"]],[508,["where can you find such people"]],[512,["who can be called anywhere near Christ's description?"]],[518,["It was inconceivable at that time."]],[524,["India is one place as I told you, people are dharmic by their own,"]],[531,["we can say,"]],[534,["their own genes you can call them,"]],[541,["or you can say they are extremely dharmic because of traditions -"]],[548,["brought up like that."]],[550,["In My time, in the South India and Maharashtra,"]],[556,["I think we were very dharmic family,"]],[559,["and it was very dharmic atmosphere."]],[563,["Still,"]],[566,["these things that Christ has described was not there."]],[573,["For example, anger was regarded as a great asset."]],[578,["People used to boast, “I am very angry with that person!”"]],[581,["they used to say."]],[584,["Very common."]],[586,["Of course I don't think in India anybody can say"]],[589,["“I hate you” because is regarded something sinful and stupid,"]],[593,["because to hate somebody is being adharmic."]],[598,["But of course they did say so many things"]],[604,["that were not at all permissible by the laws of Christ."]],[615,["And then came Mohammed Sahib,"]],[618,["who just found that nothing works out."]],[622,["So I think they adopted shariat - but not Mohammed Sahib -"]],[626,["but they had adopted already the shariat."]],[631,["He accepted."]],[633,["He said, “All right, this shariat can be worked out.\""]],[636,["But it is so inhuman and has no balance,"]],[641,["because only the women have to suffer; no, nothing to men."]],[647,["If a woman did adultery then she was punished, but not the man."]],[653,["Even, I don't know what is the law here,"]],[656,["but in India if a woman who is married does adultery,"]],[661,["such a man has to be punished,"]],[664,["but if the married man does adultery there is no punishment."]],[671,["All these things, I know, cannot be forced on anyone."]],[680,["Whatever Christ must have said,"]],[682,["He must have said in His own meditative mood."]],[686,["He was surrounded by people"]],[689,["who tried to kill Him, and they killed Him ultimately."]],[694,["And the kind of people they were,"]],[696,["specially at that time the Romans"]],[700,["– extremely cruel."]],[705,["So how can He say that if you,"]],[708,["somebody slaps you on one cheek, you turn another cheek to that person?"]],[713,["Very angry, hot-tempered people were there."]],[720,["Krishna, of course, said it very clearly"]],[724,["that “krodhat bhavati samnoha” – is krodh is the worst thing,"]],[727,["anger is the worst sin according to Him,"]],[731,["from - only from anger everything comes out."]],[737,["But He didn't say how the anger comes in."]],[741,["He didn't talk about it that the source of anger was your liver,"]],[748,["and also your upbringing."]],[750,["These two things give you horrible anger."]],[757,["Unless and until you witness yourself,"]],[763,["your realization has no meaning."]],[767,["You should separate yourself from yourself,"]],[772,["and see for yourself what is really wrong with you."]],[779,["Now supposing somebody is a very hot-tempered person,"]],[783,["instead of taking pride in it"]],[788,["or using that temper to control others,"]],[793,["he should try to control himself."]],[797,["How?"]],[799,["First is the krodha."]],[802,["Anybody who wants to be a saint should know"]],[807,["that anger, this krodha, should have no place."]],[814,["And how do you do it?"]],[816,["You first of all witness yourself how you behave."]],[821,["For example,"]],[823,["I would say artificially you become angry, artificially,"]],[829,["and stand before the mirror."]],[831,["See your face, how you look like."]],[834,["You'll be surprised,"]],[836,["looks like a face of a monkey or a tiger,"]],[839,["or I don't know what animal you must have been in last life."]],[847,["And then you are amazed"]],[848,["that you are still carrying the traces of that previous life"]],[852,["that was whatever was the animal."]],[856,["Then the second thing would be, take out the anger upon yourself."]],[863,["As we have in Sahaja Yoga, we write down our own names and beat it."]],[870,["But it is, should be that if you get angry with yourself,"]],[878,["then you will see"]],[881,["that you have won over your anger."]],[889,["Because angry people only torture others,"]],[892,["they don't torture themselves. Of course sometimes they feel bad,"]],[896,["later on they feel “I should not have done this,”"]],[898,["they develop a left Vishuddhi."]],[902,["But, mainly if you start getting angry with yourself –"]],[910,["“Why should I have done this? Why did I do this?\""]],[914,["\"Why should I get tempted to this?” –"]],[917,["you'll be surprised, your temper will go down."]],[923,["And also physically you should see you have a liver problem."]],[929,["With that you just face yourself"]],[932,["and tell that “I’m going to get rid of this liver problem."]],[935,["How dare it become my enemy"]],[943,["and stop my ascent in spirituality.”"]],[948,["So the first, the witness state has to be developed."]],[951,["For a Sahaja yogi is very important to develop a witness state."]],[956,["But normally what happens"]],[958,["that Sahaja yogis develop a witness state for others."]],[965,["Now you know in Sahaja Yoga the door is open to everyone;"]],[970,["and some mad people also walk in,"]],[973,["some funny people also walk in,"]],[977,["some very bad-charactered people also walk in,"]],[980,["all kinds of things happen."]],[983,["So now you should see,"]],[988,["what are you worried about?"]],[995,["Are you worried about people who have problems,"]],[1000,["who are no good, for whom you cannot say that they'll be Sahaja yogis;"]],[1006,["or you are enjoying the people who have got Sahaja Yoga?"]],[1015,["This temper sometimes has made people really mad, I tell you,"]],[1019,["can go into your head and can make you mad;"]],[1022,["and we have some mad people in Sahaja Yoga, we have still."]],[1027,["But they have become so mad that now they are no more angry,"]],[1033,["they are no more troublesome, they are just mad, that's all."]],[1040,["For such people you shouldn't worry."]],[1044,["There's no need to witness others – witness yourself."]],[1053,["And I sometimes feel"]],[1056,["that anger comes through too much austerity,"]],[1063,["too much of extreme nature also."]],[1067,["Some Sahaja yogis are extremely austere,"]],[1074,["austere about everything. It's maddening."]],[1078,["In Sahaja Yoga there is, everything is Sahaj, it’s spontaneous."]],[1084,["You are not to be austere. You should not be particular."]],[1090,["Now, I said now it's not better,"]],[1092,["not to wear a black sari or something, if I say so –"]],[1097,["then it doesn't become a sentence from Brahma!"]],[1102,["Supposing then somebody is wearing a black sari and coming,"]],[1106,["you will all run away from that person –"]],[1109,["or black clothes. It's not that."]],[1112,["You are gurus yourself;"]],[1116,["why should you be afraid of any kind of person who comes to you,"]],[1120,["whether it is black, white, or any type?"]],[1124,["Why should you have any fear? The another side of temper is fear."]],[1131,["A man who is hot-tempered always have fear"]],[1136,["because he sees himself in others."]],[1140,["He sees that \"another person also must be having the same kind of temper,"]],[1147,["and he'll attack me,\" so he's always on the protective."]],[1154,["In a Sahaj manner"]],[1158,["what we do is to live without fear."]],[1166,["It's said that wages of sin is fear,"]],[1171,["but I would say wages of anger."]],[1174,["Those people who were very aggressive, say for example,"]],[1179,["develop frights, all kinds of frights."]],[1183,["Those countries who have invaded other countries"]],[1187,["and rule other countries,"]],[1190,["and have got the experience of their ego, of their anger,"]],[1198,["become extremely frightened people."]],[1202,["Specially the soldiers"]],[1204,["who go on the war, kill so many people and come back,"]],[1208,["and they are frightened."]],[1210,["I asked one of them in America, I said, “What are you frightened of?”"]],[1215,["He said, “I feel that I have killed so many people,"]],[1217,["now so many will kill me.”"]],[1219,["But I said, “Why do you think like that?\""]],[1221,["\"Why should anybody kill you?”"]],[1223,["He says, “Because, why did I kill others?\""]],[1227,["\"Why did I kill others? Because I killed others,"]],[1232,["so anybody can kill me, isn’t it, without rhyme and reason.”"]],[1237,["Logically I agreed. But his fear was so much"]],[1241,["that when he came in My presence he was just shaking,"]],[1243,["the whole body was shaking with fear."]],[1247,["So, whatever aggression we do boomerangs on us,"]],[1253,["and we become very frightened about everything."]],[1259,["In Sahaj you witness yourself as a separate identity."]],[1264,["All your past is finished, gone, you are not bothered,"]],[1270,["and you remain in a state which is fearless."]],[1279,["This state has to be achieved through Sahaja Yoga."]],[1284,["Very easy, once you know that you are protected you'll have no fear,"]],[1290,["and as you'll have no fear you will not have also temper."]],[1296,["It works vice versa sometimes."]],[1299,["It's a very common thing I have seen,"]],[1302,["a very aggressive person will be described by a psychologist"]],[1308,["as a man of insecurity."]],[1312,["It's nice to say that, but it's not true."]],[1316,["He makes everybody insecured, then how can he be insecure?"]],[1323,["If another person feels insecure with that person,"]],[1327,["that means this man is not insecured,"]],[1331,["but he is over-secured."]],[1334,["If you tell him that, then only he will improve."]],[1338,["But if you say, “You have insecurity,”"]],[1340,["then he thinks, “Yes, my condition is pitiable.\""]],[1343,["\"Even if I kill somebody is all right,"]],[1345,["because my condition is pitiable.”"]],[1349,["Such arguments work out"]],[1353,["in such a manner, that you become convinced about yourself."]],[1360,["But if you see as a witness"]],[1364,["you see, “What have I done so far?\""]],[1370,["\"Have I been able to conquer myself?”"]],[1376,["Sahaja Yoga is not to conquer others or to control others,"]],[1381,["but to conquer yourself."]],[1384,["If you have not done that, you can be self-certified -"]],[1388,["“Oh, I have been a Sahaja yogi, I have been so great,"]],[1391,["I have been this, I am -” that makes no difference."]],[1394,["Have you completely transformed yourself, changed yourself,"]],[1399,["and now in your presence do people feel secured?"]],[1408,["If they feel insecure, then something wrong with you."]],[1412,["Or if you feel insecure, also there’s something wrong with you."]],[1417,["Now this excuse to give, that “Mother, I am insecure” –"]],[1423,["then you are not a Sahaja yogi, as simple as that."]],[1429,["Giving explanation like that shows you are not even a Sahaja yogi."]],[1434,["So now to become the guru, first of all,"]],[1438,["you should have a great sense of forgiveness."]],[1445,["So much so like Buddha's."]],[1447,["Once Buddha was giving a lecture in a village"]],[1452,["and suddenly somebody came in and started abusing Him,"]],[1456,["saying all kinds of things and all that."]],[1461,["Then somebody told him, “What are you doing?"]],[1465,["He is Buddha, the one who's Enlightened One. He’s trying to help us"]],[1469,["to become good, and you came and shouted at Him?”"]],[1475,["So he was repentant."]],[1478,["He went to see Buddha, but Buddha had gone to another village."]],[1483,["So he went to another village, second day,"]],[1486,["and he went and fell at the feet of Lord Buddha."]],[1491,["Lord Buddha said, “What's the matter?\" \"Why are you falling at My feet?”"]],[1497,["He said, “Sir, I must say"]],[1500,["that I was, really I didn't know You were the Enlightened One."]],[1504,["I just shouted at You, said things, I don't know what happened to me."]],[1508,["So please forgive me.”"]],[1510,["He said, “When did you say this to Me?”"]],[1513,["“Yesterday.” “Where?” “In such place.”"]],[1517,["He said, “Yesterday is finished now.\" \"What is there to forgive?”"]],[1525,["Now, he came begging of His forgiveness, repenting."]],[1530,["Immediately He said, “Yesterday is over.”"]],[1537,["That is one of the greatest qualities Sahaja yogis should have."]],[1545,["To call yourself a guru you must also have maturity."]],[1553,["And the maturity part is sometimes very -"]],[1556,["Like yesterday in the drama. I was surprised when the -"]],[1562,["it took some time, some people came in, went."]],[1565,["They were giggling just like children. It shows no maturity, no respect."]],[1571,["Hah, anything laughable is there of course one can laugh,"]],[1577,["or any enjoyment is there - but shows such childishness."]],[1581,["They are doing some drama, making fun of them."]],[1588,["Very common with Sahaja yogis I have seen, specially ladies."]],[1593,["They laugh at things where they should never laugh."]],[1596,["I am sitting there"]],[1600,["and you are watching something,"]],[1604,["what is there to laugh?"]],[1608,["Shows complete immaturity!"]],[1613,["Another thing I have seen is in small, small things,"]],[1616,["specially in money matters, it’s very funny. I have to tell you this:"]],[1621,["Turkish people, our Sahaja yogis have no money,"]],[1626,["everything was stolen away from them."]],[1628,["So I said, “All right, you send some shirts here"]],[1631,["and we'll sell those shirts,"]],[1633,["and extra money you can take it,” because they would not take money from Me."]],[1639,["So when they sent the shirt here, it was - they said that “Mother,"]],[1643,["I don't know marketing,\""]],[1644,["they said, “Mother, it should be twenty-one dollars, twenty-two dollars.”"]],[1648,["Many of them said it is expensive."]],[1653,["Then I said, “All right, collect money from everyone,"]],[1656,["twenty-two dollars each without giving any shirt,"]],[1659,["finished – for Turkey.”"]],[1664,["But a false guru takes money from you, you don't mind."]],[1670,["Sahaja Yoga is free of course,"]],[1674,["no doubt. Sahaja Yoga is free."]],[1678,["But you have to contribute."]],[1682,["How are we to run this Sahaja Yoga?"]],[1685,["There's no sense of donation in you, at all."]],[1689,["For a guru, one must know how to donate."]],[1695,["I am surprised sometimes, there is no sense of donation."]],[1700,["We got something, say, terracotta from India, to help those people;"]],[1706,["and I was surprised that these Belgian women are so funny"]],[1709,["that they were telling everybody it is expensive."]],[1714,["If they don't want to buy, they need not buy."]],[1717,["Others were willing to buy but they, these women were telling"]],[1720,["that these things are expensive."]],[1722,["Where do you contribute for Sahaja Yoga?"]],[1732,["Now we had to have this pendal."]],[1736,["We had to have all kinds of things. What do you contribute?"]],[1741,["This attachment to money can never be good for a guru."]],[1745,["I have no attachment at all. If you ask anyone they'll tell you,"]],[1750,["even My husband will tell that,"]],[1754,["that from inside I am absolutely detached."]],[1757,["I don't know also, I don't know banking,"]],[1759,["I don't know how to keep accounts,"]],[1761,["somebody keep accounts, somebody does that."]],[1763,["But this attachment to money in Sahaja Yoga –"]],[1768,["I won't say like Christ that you'll all go to hell,"]],[1771,["but you won't rise much higher."]],[1775,["You have come for your spiritual ascent."]],[1777,["I don't say you go to Himalayas, stand in the cold,"]],[1780,["stand on your heads, nothing of the kind."]],[1785,["But the another defect they call in Me is"]],[1793,["that I never tell them that “you must contribute.”"]],[1800,["It is to be done with pleasure, with happiness,"]],[1805,["that you can contribute something to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1814,["In any case, whether you give it or not,"]],[1817,["I'll have to contribute for Turkey, no doubt."]],[1820,["I'll do that."]],[1825,["Now this kind of a thing as a market is there –"]],[1828,["“It's very expensive. This is cheap, this, that” –"]],[1831,["this is just an excuse because I know you can never contribute"]],[1834,["even twenty dollars for anything."]],[1837,["So I bring their clothes, all right."]],[1842,["They have stitched the shirts, sent it here, and now –"]],[1848,["I'm surprised."]],[1850,["But if the free presents are given, it's very much acceptable,"]],[1855,["and nobody sees how expensive it is."]],[1860,["So now I would say that on money matters"]],[1863,["a guru has to be absolutely detached and giving, and generous."]],[1871,["You'll enjoy your generosity but the problem is,"]],[1874,["you are not generous at all."]],[1878,["You think Sahaja Yoga is another market-place where you have come."]],[1887,["So the generosity part is so much missing,"]],[1892,["and it is very surprising."]],[1897,["They asked Me that “Mother, please,"]],[1899,["we need some chiffon skirts and blouses for this summer.”"]],[1905,["You stitch them for them, bring all the way;"]],[1908,["nobody wants to buy, it's all lying there."]],[1912,["There's no shopping here. So I'm going to tell you that"]],[1916,["as long as all these things are exhausted,"]],[1918,["I am not going to ask any country to send anything here for sale."]],[1930,["To believe that you are Sahaja yogis, you are sadly mistaken."]],[1934,["Your attention so much - you'll go to hairdressers,"]],[1937,["you'll do all kinds of things, but for Sahaja Yoga you have no money."]],[1943,["Today, as everybody has said,"]],[1948,["“Mother, you should be little stern, You must tell,” I'm telling you this."]],[1953,["Your progress will be very slow."]],[1962,["Secondly, you have to introspect to find out,"]],[1966,["what have you done for Sahaja Yoga?"]],[1970,["How many people you have given realization? You have powers."]],[1976,["These gurus never had powers, though they were realized souls;"]],[1979,["you have powers to give realization, how many of you have done it?"]],[1984,["And once you start doing that,"]],[1986,["you get about ten people, twenty people from somewhere,"]],[1989,["you become great masters"]],[1991,["and you start talking about your great mastery"]],[1995,["and that you know everything,"]],[1998,["that you are the guru, you are the Adi Shakti."]],[2004,["This is at the Agnya level."]],[2007,["As soon as you reach the Agnya level you get this into your heads."]],[2014,["So many, of course, have done so much for Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2017,["otherwise it would not have been possible to see this today."]],[2021,["For all those who have not done anything,"]],[2024,["I must tell you that you are just standing at the same steps."]],[2029,["Your kundalini has risen but you have done nothing,"]],[2032,["nothing to give it to others."]],[2035,["Unless and until you give it, you cannot grow."]],[2040,["There are many I know who don't want to give"]],[2043,["because they think “we'll catch.”"]],[2045,["Don't want to look after others because they think they'll get egos."]],[2054,["This is not the way to be in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2058,["You have to do something which is very important, to spread Sahaja Yoga."]],[2064,["We are talking of global peace, of global transformation,"]],[2069,["and what are we doing for it?"]],[2074,["First improve your quality. And that improvement can only come"]],[2080,["through sincere, honest introspection,"]],[2084,["and also witnessing yourself every moment, how you behave."]],[2097,["I must tell you about Myself,"]],[2099,["that from My very childhood I was like a grandmother."]],[2106,["I would not tolerate anything nonsense,"]],[2109,["any stupid jokes, anything, like a grandmother."]],[2114,["And now I am a grandmother also."]],[2120,["And this maturity has to come in you."]],[2125,["To talk cheaply is all right,"]],[2130,["some people have that habit – they are no Sahaja yogis."]],[2132,["But the ones who follow them and talk like that,"]],[2137,["shows that they have no maturity."]],[2139,["If they were matured they would change all these people."]],[2145,["Whenever there are matured people, they definitely transform others."]],[2151,["And their own behaviour, people are surprised how they are."]],[2159,["This may be exceptional, may be very few like that."]],[2165,["But only thing why I am pointing it out to you,"]],[2168,["that when you find somebody like that,"]],[2172,["then please try not to listen to such a person,"]],[2179,["not to follow such a person."]],[2181,["But such a person is extremely forward type"]],[2184,["and everybody becomes sort of a follower"]],[2187,["of such a useless Sahaja yogi, so-called."]],[2193,["So we have to mature. Now how do we mature?"]],[2198,["Many ask Me this question."]],[2201,["We mature by meditation, by nirvicharita."]],[2207,["You have to be in thoughtless awareness to grow,"]],[2210,["otherwise you cannot grow."]],[2212,["Now, you should practice this thoughtless awareness otherwise also."]],[2218,["Say you are walking on the road, suddenly you see a beautiful tree,"]],[2225,["you should become thoughtless. Creation of Divine –"]],[2229,["how beautiful it is! You should become thoughtless."]],[2232,["In thoughtless Sahaj works, otherwise it does not work."]],[2236,["You plan everything, you do everything, it won't work out."]],[2241,["If you leave it to Sahaj, it will work out."]],[2244,["But that never means that you should be lazy about it,"]],[2249,["or also unsystematic – no."]],[2255,["You have to be alert, extremely alert, because if you are not alert"]],[2260,["you will not see how the Sahaj is helping you."]],[2266,["I'll give an example."]],[2269,["Supposing you want to meet somebody."]],[2273,["Now that person has said, “I'll meet you at eleven o'clock,” say for example."]],[2278,["You have to be alert. He said he'll meet you at eleven."]],[2282,["By some chance you are late, supposing."]],[2289,["So you should be alert that you are late for the gentleman."]],[2293,["At that time, you should give a bandhan or raise your kundalini,"]],[2299,["do something, so that you meet that person in any case,"]],[2303,["whether you are late or not. But normally you should not be late."]],[2308,["If you just give a bandhan and say,"]],[2310,["“I must be there at eleven o'clock,” you'll be there."]],[2313,["Sahaj will help you."]],[2316,["But you even forget to give bandhans,"]],[2318,["you even forget to raise your kundalini,"]],[2320,["you even forget to give vibrations."]],[2325,["So to mature, first of all you should know you are now Sahaja yogis,"]],[2330,["and that you can control the whole situation"]],[2335,["if you are one with this all-pervading Power."]],[2342,["It's very simple."]],[2345,["It was very hot, everybody was saying it's very hot. All right."]],[2349,["I got up, I said, “I'll make it,” within fifteen minutes I made it cool."]],[2356,["I say, “I made it” – “I,” but it's not “I.”"]],[2360,["My connection with this all-pervading Power has done the job."]],[2365,["But the connection has to be sincere, strong, honest,"]],[2372,["and all the time in your mind you should know"]],[2379,["that you are connected."]],[2382,["This situation is very simple to achieve,"]],[2387,["this state where you all the time feel “I am one with the Divine”."]],[2395,["Because you are not alert,"]],[2397,["you don't want to see the miracles of this great Power"]],[2404,["which you are in connection."]],[2407,["You are busy with other things, your attention is somewhere else,"]],[2412,["you're looking at other things."]],[2416,["And then suddenly you say, “Mother, how is it I am such a Sahaja yogi,"]],[2421,["I could not do this and that?”"]],[2431,["What's going on there?"]],[2437,["Even when I am speaking I see people are busy with something else."]],[2445,["So what you call,"]],[2447,["is to mature through your meditation in nirvicharita –"]],[2456,["in thoughtless awareness."]],[2462,["Unless and until you enlarge the state of thoughtless awareness"]],[2470,["you cannot mature, because only in the present you can mature,"]],[2475,["and present is thoughtless awareness."]],[2481,["And I have seen what is happening,"]],[2484,["that people are only expecting"]],[2493,["all kinds of miracles from Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2497,["all kinds of help from Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2501,["but they never think “what help are we doing?\""]],[2513,["\"What are we achieving?\""]],[2516,["\"Where are we?”"]],[2521,["So at the Agnya again,"]],[2523,["you people have to be extremely, extremely careful."]],[2529,["Now this is for men."]],[2532,["If you have not crossed your Agnya"]],[2535,["and you start spreading Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2539,["then you can become really a funny person,"]],[2545,["not a Sahaja yogi."]],[2548,["This leadership business is a myth,"]],[2553,["and this myth must be seen as a myth."]],[2557,["Whether you are leader or not leader makes no difference."]],[2564,["But the maturity has to come."]],[2566,["Now I am telling all this because"]],[2569,["I have decided not to punish anybody in this lifetime."]],[2576,["So that you see for yourself,"]],[2581,["yourself you understand,"]],[2584,["yourself you realize. I know you very well, all of you, somehow."]],[2590,["But I want you to realize yourself,"]],[2595,["“What are we doing wrong?\" \"Where are we doing right?”"]],[2599,["and don't judge Sahaja Yoga on what merits you get out of it."]],[2606,["If you are not getting merits, there's something wrong with you."]],[2611,["If you can really understand this,"]],[2614,["then you will become subtler and subtler"]],[2617,["and all your gross attachments will become absolutely negligible."]],[2624,["You may have concern, but you won't have attachment."]],[2630,["From inside, this complete detachment has to come in."]],[2638,["And that can come, as I told you,"]],[2642,["getting rid of your anger, first."]],[2647,["Secondly, getting rid of attachments to material things,"]],[2655,["by generosity."]],[2661,["It's nice to give something to somebody,"]],[2664,["you enjoy your generosity, you really enjoy."]],[2669,["Generosity is to be enjoyed."]],[2673,["And once you start enjoying your generosity,"]],[2680,["then you realize that"]],[2685,["you, your love, your compassion,"]],[2689,["it has now started flowing to others."]],[2693,["Little, little things are there."]],[2698,["I have seen you all love Me and you do want always to give Me"]],[2702,["presents, presents, presents, presents, all right."]],[2706,["But this love must spread to everybody else."]],[2714,["You must know about others also,"]],[2717,["what they need and what you have to do."]],[2725,["If somebody needs something, can you get it for that person?"]],[2730,["Can you love that person?"]],[2732,["Can you give it to the children of other people,"]],[2739,["something that you have?"]],[2743,["If this generosity could be just, maybe, I don't know,"]],[2750,["because I don't have to force Myself to be generous."]],[2753,["Everybody says, “Mother, You are too generous” –"]],[2755,["in My family everybody thinks I am very generous and a gone case –"]],[2759,["but I don't have to generate."]],[2761,["But perhaps you people through introspection"]],[2765,["will definitely become generous,"]],[2771,["and this generosity will start flowing."]],[2775,["I've known people who have lots of money, lots of things,"]],[2779,["but not one single pai they'll give to Sahaja Yoga, not one single pai."]],[2788,["This sense of generosity comes"]],[2792,["when you understand what is your purpose of life, why you are here."]],[2799,["Just to fulfil yourself with Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2803,["or to be able to do something about it"]],[2810,["without feeling that you have done something?"]],[2814,["In this Christ has said very nicely –"]],[2818,["I mean that He has said it, but where do you find this? –"]],[2820,["that your left hand should not know what your right hand has given,"]],[2827,["should never trumpet, “I, I, I, I, I.”"]],[2832,["What Christ has said, to achieve that"]],[2836,["you had to have realization, no doubt."]],[2840,["But I would say fifth chapter of Matthews you read."]],[2845,["Such things, so subtle He did that you'll be surprised that"]],[2850,["how this religion in the name of Christ has gone on the other side of it."]],[2862,["Now people want to be gurus"]],[2865,["because they think you have powers;"]],[2871,["that you can overpower others,"]],[2874,["you can say whatever you like to others,"]],[2877,["you can torture anyone you feel like."]],[2884,["That has been before, I know."]],[2888,["Gurus have been very, very …"]],[2890,["very, very cruel to their disciples also, I know that."]],[2895,["Once I went to Ambarnath,"]],[2898,["and one gentleman came to see Me,"]],[2901,["his name was Swami Jagannath, and he said that"]],[2905,["“My guru has told me that Adi Shakti is going to come to Ambarnath,"]],[2912,["and I will try to come at that time.”"]],[2914,["I said, “Who is your guru?” So he told Me some name."]],[2919,["He was a realized soul, no doubt. So he came down."]],[2925,["He said, “Mother, should he come to You, or You will go to him?”"]],[2929,["I said, “See, I am a Mother. I am not a guru.”"]],[2932,["The gurus don't leave their places, can you imagine?"]],[2936,["They call it takhya."]],[2939,["The guru should not leave his place,"]],[2940,["should sit there and everybody must come to him."]],[2943,["I said, “I am the Mother, I will go and meet him.”"]],[2948,["So I met him"]],[2951,["and the fellow who had come, this Jagannath fellow -"]],[2955,["I said, “What's the matter with you?"]],[2957,["Why don't you open his Agnya? He's in so much pain.”"]],[2962,["He said, “Who opened my Agnya? Why should I open his Agnya?”"]],[2967,["I said, “You are the guru, you are the master.”"]],[2969,["“So what? My guru never opened my Agnya."]],[2972,["I had to fight my ego all the time"]],[2974,["and that's how I have got everything all right.”"]],[2979,["So I said, “It's so easy to open the Agnya. Why can't you open?”"]],[2984,["So I turned his Agnya and opened it, he was very happy."]],[2988,["He said, “You are a mother, You do what You like."]],[2990,["We are not going to do this."]],[2993,["If you don't make them work hard for their realization,"]],[2997,["if you don't make them work hard for their development,"]],[3002,["they will never be all right. These human beings are like this.”"]],[3006,["I said, “Not for Me.”"]],[3008,["He said, “All right, You are a mother, You forgive them,"]],[3011,["You do what You like, You try to transform them, help them. But not me.”"]],[3017,["I said, “All right.” But you know, he came at My feet and all that,"]],[3020,["and he said that “You must praise."]],[3023,["She is Adi Shakti. You must praise Her now.”"]],[3025,["He was there for a short time. Then we were coming home,"]],[3029,["then this Baba Jagannath tells Me,"]],[3032,["“Mother, thank God You have opened my Agnya.”"]],[3036,["So I said, “What happened?”"]],[3038,["“My guru when I came, he gave me two slaps on the face."]],[3042,["I was running his ashram, supposed to be the guru."]],[3045,["Two slaps, and put me upside down on the well."]],[3051,["And all the time my feet were tied up to the rope"]],[3057,["which he used to lower down, again bring me up."]],[3061,["So he put me again and again into the water seven times,"]],[3066,["then he pulled me out.” I said, “Baba, why did he do that?”"]],[3070,["He said, “I must tell You that I have been smoking sometimes.”"]],[3076,["For that."]],[3078,["But I said, “He never gave you realization?"]],[3081,["You would be smoking in any case, that’s it.”"]],[3084,["“He wants me to give up all these bad habits with my Agnya on."]],[3089,["Now You have opened my Agnya, I'm all right.”"]],[3091,["So I felt that the behaviour of that guru was very surprising."]],[3098,["He says, “He beats us."]],[3100,["He always beats us for anything and we have to work very hard.”"]],[3105,["I also know of the, some gurus of the music also do that,"]],[3110,["and I met so many of such people who have been to very great gurus"]],[3116,["and the way I got the report was so shocking to Me,"]],[3122,["that why don't they tell them directly that"]],[3124,["“See, this is wrong with you, and this is how you should be”?"]],[3129,["But the gurus say that if you tell them like that,"]],[3132,["they'll never listen."]],[3135,["“They only know the beating.”"]],[3138,["I said, “Ba! What do you say?"]],[3142,["They only know beatings?” “Yes.”"]],[3144,["So the whole attitude towards the disciple"]],[3148,["is not of compassion, in fact."]],[3152,["There are of course other gurus also"]],[3154,["who take a terrible test of their disciples."]],[3161,["Like as you see, Shri Ramdasa."]],[3163,["This was nothing compared to what Raja Janaka did."]],[3168,["They will test the person and then only give realization,"]],[3173,["and out of thousands, to one only."]],[3180,["That is how we've got so many false gurus also,"]],[3183,["because they were all discarded by these realized souls, so."]],[3189,["At this point"]],[3193,["we have people who have got realization,"]],[3200,["when the real gurus are like this."]],[3206,["I met another one, he asked Me,"]],[3210,["“Why are You giving realization to all these useless people?”"]],[3214,["I said, “Why?” And there were some Sahaja yogis,"]],[3216,["he said, “How many can give life for Shri Mataji?”"]],[3221,["I said, “Why do you want to ask for their life? I don't want their life.”"]],[3225,["He said, “This is the first question,\" he said,"]],[3229,["\"those - I have many who will give life for me.”"]],[3232,["And he has not given them realization."]],[3236,["So now at this juncture, when we have people who are seeking,"]],[3242,["who are going to these gurus –"]],[3243,["of course false gurus you forget, but even real gurus –"]],[3247,["they do not get their realization."]],[3250,["Now, you are capable of giving them realization – just imagine."]],[3256,["They have big, big ashrams and things like that,"]],[3258,["they cannot give realization."]],[3262,["While you can, all of you can give."]],[3268,["Now, it's like this,"]],[3272,["that if you put little light in a lamp"]],[3282,["and it is just giving light to itself, nothing else, supposing."]],[3291,["Now you have to give light to others."]],[3295,["You have powers, you can do it."]],[3301,["You can really change people, you can cure them –"]],[3309,["but, you will not."]],[3311,["You will bring all these sick people to Me, “Mother, You cure.”"]],[3318,["Even for realization I've seen they bring people to Me."]],[3324,["What is the need?"]],[3325,["You all know how to give realization, how to cure a person."]],[3331,["All of you know."]],[3335,["Now why is it that you people cannot do it?"]],[3340,["Firstly, you may not be matured enough."]],[3344,["But even if you are mature,"]],[3347,["you are not assuming your own powers,"]],[3350,["you don't believe in it."]],[3355,["Humility is all right, but you must know what power it is."]],[3361,["Supposing somebody is a king, say,"]],[3365,["and you put him on the throne."]],[3369,["Now if people are coming and instead of they touching his feet,"]],[3373,["he goes and touches each and everybody's feet –"]],[3376,["this is no humility. This is nonsense."]],[3381,["Whatever position you have,"]],[3385,["you should try to do with humility, means through compassion."]],[3396,["The maturity is this, that you should know that you have these powers,"]],[3402,["you should know how to preserve these powers,"]],[3404,["you should know how to grow in peace,"]],[3408,["and then when you meet people you should assume, inside."]],[3419,["I may be a housewife cooking for My grandchildren,"]],[3424,["doing this, doing that."]],[3428,["But once I am sitting on the chair, I know what I am."]],[3436,["You may be anything - you may be a clerk, you may be dishwasher,"]],[3440,["you may be anything, that makes no difference."]],[3443,["But once you are a Sahaja yogi, you are a Sahaja yogi."]],[3449,["Then you must show your dignity"]],[3454,["and not thrive on your weaknesses."]],[3459,["You are much better than all these realized souls"]],[3462,["who have achieved their realization in thousands of years,"]],[3466,["because you have so many powers."]],[3469,["But their self-confidence"]],[3476,["and assumption is not with you."]],[3483,["Some people say, “We are afraid of ego.” How can you have ego?"]],[3487,["It's finished."]],[3494,["Even if you do some mistakes, doesn't matter."]],[3499,["“Mother, I touched my left foot, I touched my right” –"]],[3502,["makes no difference."]],[3507,["Because of no self-confidence you become austere in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3515,["If you are self-confident,"]],[3519,["then why should you be austere?"]],[3526,["It all goes together."]],[3529,["First you must mature, with that you must have self-confidence,"]],[3535,["and without fear you should spread Sahaja Yoga."]],[3541,["Some have fear about themselves and some have fear about others."]],[3547,["Also it comes from your conditionings, from your upbringing."]],[3552,["So today's Guru Puja is in a way very important,"]],[3557,["because everybody said, “Mother, You should be stern,"]],[3559,["You must tell them and You must - ”"]],[3561,["I said, “All right, I'll tell them.”"]],[3563,["But in no way to put you down, no way;"]],[3567,["but to tell you what you can achieve."]],[3571,["To tell you how far you can go."]],[3573,["You, so many are more than sufficient"]],[3578,["to transform at least ten globes,"]],[3582,["ten worlds, more than sufficient."]],[3586,["But you are still involved in yourself, worried about yourself,"]],[3590,["only your children, your husband, this, that –"]],[3595,["doesn't work out."]],[3599,["As much as you want to grow,"]],[3603,["this power can give you that power."]],[3609,["But problem that lies with us is that"]],[3613,["we don't know ourselves,"]],[3616,["and we don't want to know ourselves."]],[3623,["Today's Guru Puja should give you the state of guru."]],[3635,["If you want, it can work out."]],[3643,["The all-pervading divine Power of Love is absolutely working it out."]],[3653,["More than you, the Divine wants this world to change,"]],[3659,["wants to transform the whole universe."]],[3662,["Now you are the instruments,"]],[3668,["and if you try to cheat yourself,"]],[3673,["who can stop it?"]],[3680,["Just to enjoy music,"]],[3684,["or to enjoy the company, or belonging to some club,"]],[3689,["or to feel that it's a nice festival;"]],[3693,["or at the most you seek"]],[3695,["the security of your children and family and all that -"]],[3703,["it is not satisfying."]],[3706,["It will never satisfy you."]],[3709,["It will only satisfy you when you will become the lights"]],[3714,["to give it to others, to work for others."]],[3719,["And you have these powers, what I'm trying to tell again and again,"]],[3722,["you have these powers by which you can introspect yourself,"]],[3727,["you can witness yourself, and you can surrender."]],[3732,["Because mentally now you are convinced about Sahaja Yoga."]],[3742,["Emotionally you are convinced"]],[3745,["that Sahaja Yoga has given you such sense of love and compassion."]],[3754,["Physically you are convinced that Sahaja Yoga has given you good health"]],[3760,["and confidence about your health."]],[3764,["Now spiritually you should be convinced, spiritually,"]],[3769,["that you are really spiritual people selected by the Divine;"]],[3776,["that your last lives have been of great seeking,"]],[3780,["that's why you are born now, and you are getting all these blessings."]],[3784,["So assume. assumption of your personality is important."]],[3792,["You must meditate, you should go into thoughtless awareness,"]],[3798,["and all the time keep your attention alert."]],[3806,["That is very important."]],[3809,["When, what is the need, when something will come,"]],[3813,["how we have to react –"]],[3819,["all these things come to you when you are alert"]],[3824,["and aware of this all-pervading Power all the time, every moment."]],[3831,["I don't worry at all, never . Everybody is surprised at Me."]],[3836,["I don't worry."]],[3840,["Why? My worry is taken over."]],[3843,["People say, “You travel, travel.” I never travel."]],[3847,["I'm sitting here or I'm sitting there, what is it?"]],[3850,["Where am I travelling?"]],[3853,["So you don't think on those lines."]],[3858,["So thoughtless awareness is the first beautiful state"]],[3866,["you have to achieve. That will give you peace"]],[3870,["and a witness state to enjoy the drama of life,"]],[3874,["to enjoy the different varieties of people,"]],[3881,["while you will be growing within yourself."]],[3888,["For a Sahaja yogi is important not to see the faults of others"]],[3895,["but your own faults, and correct them."]],[3899,["I get so many letters regarding some lady"]],[3904,["or some leader or somebody like that."]],[3907,["That “Mother, this leader is troubling me,"]],[3909,["that leader is troubling me, this, that.”"]],[3911,["I'm surprised."]],[3916,["I will change the leader as soon as I’ll find something wrong,"]],[3919,["I've always done –"]],[3921,["who is not suitable, who is in problem, is always done."]],[3925,["But the way you put your attention to the leader is"]],[3928,["perhaps the jealousy part."]],[3932,["If the leader says something wrong with you, you should thank him."]],[3935,["Who is there to tell you?"]],[3941,["I'm very proud of you, I'm very happy,"]],[3944,["that never such disciples existed for any guru."]],[3949,["If I'm a guru, I should say, I should say now done, finished, - overjoyed."]],[3956,["But when I see that you people don't realize what you have achieved,"]],[3960,["and you don't want to work it out,"]],[3963,["then I think of the parable of Christ"]],[3965,["that some seeds fell on the rock."]],[3973,["All your affection, all your love,"]],[3978,["I know it is impossible to express what I feel about it."]],[3983,["But you don't know why you got realization,"]],[3986,["why you are here, what is your speciality, what you have to get."]],[3990,["You don't know that."]],[3993,["And that is what you have to know."]],[3996,["I don't say like Christ that take out one eye"]],[4000,["or take out one, cut out your hand – nothing of the kind."]],[4006,["You’ll be intact, your body should be intact, nothing is to be taken out."]],[4011,["We need this body. But,"]],[4016,["in a subtle way what He was saying,"]],[4018,["that whatever part of your body is doing wrong,"]],[4022,["you should try to negate it – in a subtle way."]],[4026,["In the same way in Sahaja Yoga also,"]],[4029,["if there is jealousy try to find out why you are a jealous,"]],[4033,["why are you against the leader?"]],[4035,["The leader says a word to somebody, they immediately write to Me."]],[4040,["Why is he leader, if he has not to tell anything?"]],[4043,["Today I think for the first time I have been able to tell something to you"]],[4049,["which I was hesitating always,"]],[4052,["that “Let it be, just now they are still little babies, it's all right.”"]],[4057,["But now, after this you have to grow,"]],[4062,["grow in every way."]],[4066,["I just can't understand."]],[4071,["Those who got realization without the power of raising the kundalini"]],[4076,["are doing such a lot of work."]],[4079,["And while you all have this power to raise the kundalini,"]],[4083,["to cure people, and also to talk about Sahaja Yoga,"]],[4088,["you are so sensible."]],[4091,["Still where is your attention, I don't understand."]],[4097,["Today's lecture should not really in any way hurt you,"]],[4105,["because I don't want to hurt you at all."]],[4109,["Whatever is the situation, I accept."]],[4112,["But if you don't want to accept that situation,"]],[4115,["what you should do I have told you."]],[4121,["This will definitely suddenly raise your spiritual height – definitely."]],[4130,["No doubt about it."]],[4132,["It's very important to see for yourself what's wrong."]],[4141,["After all, you are all seekers of truth for ages,"]],[4145,["and now you've come, you have found the truth."]],[4148,["So try to identify yourself with truth, that's all."]],[4155,["And with reality."]],[4157,["If you identify yourself with truth and with reality,"]],[4162,["your Sahasrara is absolutely open. No problem."]],[4167,["Truth is in your Sahasrara."]],[4171,["And when the truth comes in, you are surprised"]],[4173,["that truth is love and love is truth –"]],[4177,["pure love."]],[4180,["It's very, very joy-giving,"]],[4183,["and all the niranandas you want to have,"]],[4187,["you can have, if you understand this simple equation"]],[4192,["that absolute truth is absolute love."]],[4200,["I have no expectations."]],[4204,["I must tell you I am oversatisfied."]],[4208,["As far as I am concerned, I think I have done My job."]],[4211,["But now this has to be taken over, you have to be responsible."]],[4218,["You have to work it out. I was so happy, this time every place I went to,"]],[4223,["all the leaders said that “Mother,"]],[4225,["You need not travel, now we take the responsibility."]],[4229,["We'll work it out.”"]],[4231,["But all of you must support your leaders and do something about it."]],[4237,["Sometimes leaders are really, they can't understand"]],[4242,["why people are having their own ideas about everything."]],[4250,["You must go all out."]],[4253,["For example, in our country when we wanted to remove the slavery,"]],[4261,["everyone joined together to achieve it."]],[4268,["While there are people who are trying to cut down the leaders,"]],[4272,["put them down, make fun of them, form groups."]],[4279,["Is this the way we are going to work it out?"]],[4287,["You all should support the leader."]],[4289,["You should all go all out to do what the leader is telling you."]],[4295,["If something is wrong with the leader I'll talk to him,"]],[4297,["then I'll put him right, I promise you."]],[4300,["But you don't try to find faults."]],[4304,["As it is all the leaders ask Me before doing something."]],[4309,["So you just try to follow the leaders, whatever the leader is saying,"]],[4313,["absolutely put all your effort."]],[4317,["Because the complaints are that you people don't listen to them –"]],[4324,["I'm really surprised."]],[4329,["Yesterday you saw he was playing sitar."]],[4333,["You should have asked him, what about his guru?"]],[4337,["His own father was his guru and he used to beat him,"]],[4340,["and then his grandfather also."]],[4345,["But with such desire to learn something, to be something"]],[4350,["that they didn't mind anything,"]],[4351,["“Beat me, do what you like, put me in jail,"]],[4355,["but make me a good artist.”"]],[4358,["In the same way is Sahaja Yoga."]],[4362,["Because there is, if you may call it a defect,"]],[4367,["Sahaja Yoga is not a military thing,"]],[4371,["it's just plain, simple, Mother's love."]],[4379,["And of course every mother wants her child to be great,"]],[4385,["to have all her powers – she wants that, no doubt."]],[4391,["How she does it, how she works it out"]],[4397,["is her own problem."]],[4399,["But how you take it and how you use it is your own problem."]],[4406,["I always bow to you people who have got realization,"]],[4409,["because I think so many saints were never there on this earth."]],[4414,["But the saintliness has to be complete."]],[4418,["Without that you cannot help even your family,"]],[4423,["leave alone your country, and no question of the whole world."]],[4431,["So what is needed now is to raise your awakening,"]],[4436,["to raise your spirituality,"]],[4439,["to go into a realm of complete support and surrender"]],[4446,["to the movement of this spontaneous movement of Sahaja Yoga."]],[4456,["May God bless you all."]],[4465,["In short, you must worship yourself – in short."]]]);
